id: E113
title: OHOS BSD类型缺失需compat头注入
error_signature: "unknown type name 'u_int'|unknown type name 'u_long'|unknown type name 'u_char'|unknown type name 'caddr_t'"
root_cause: "OpenHarmony/HarmonyOS系统头文件不含BSD风格类型定义(u_int/u_long/u_char/caddr_t)，POSIX标准未要求这些类型"
affected_scope: "任何包含BSD代码的C库（如usrsctp/libevent/ncurses等）"
platforms: ["OHOS"]
build_systems: ["cmake", "autotools", "makefile"]
severity: 2
rec_priority: true
verification_cmd: "grep -r 'u_int\\|u_long\\|u_char\\|caddr_t' deps/"
solution_steps:
  - 1: "创建ohos_compat.h头文件，定义缺失的BSD类型和宏(IFNAMSIZ/timercmp/timeradd/timersub)"
  - 2: "cmake项目通过CMAKE_C_FLAGS=-include ohos_compat.h注入；autotools项目通过CFLAGS=-include注入"
  - 3: "补丁内容使用#if平台检测(#if !defined(__FreeBSD__)&&!defined(__APPLE__)&&!defined(_WIN32))而非#ifdef __OHOS__"
  - 4: "⚠️ compat类型定义不能放在#if defined(__APPLE__)块内——在OHOS上__APPLE__未定义，整个块被跳过"
related_errors: ["E080"]
software_example: "libdatachannel/0.24.0"

